<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 75 MLN OF ONE-YR BONDS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 75 MLN OF ONE-YR BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 75 million zlotys of one-year index-linked bonds at the treasury's 391 million tender, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today. </p>
<p>--  Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
